{"unit_id":"lx963__dsh-webui-background#caveat-1","repo":"lx963/dsh-webui-background","commit":"5c5db9a8d2745d7d25e0134de6be0b18c5652644","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webui-background 的状态可由远程页面读取，但上传、修改和重置只允许 loopback 页面调用；远程连接下设置页为只读。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:154-179","src/client/index.tsx:30-70"]}
